<title>USA: Apache Corp sets $150 mln in debentures.</title>
<headline>Apache Corp sets $150 mln in debentures.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Apache Corp was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER APACHE CORP</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 7.625 PCT  MATURITY 11/01/2096</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 99.45   FIRST PAY DATE 5/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD 7.667 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD +95 BP     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>UNDERLYING U.S. TREASURY 6.00 PERCENT BOND DUE 02/15/26</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
